{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 8, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt depart for Japan's fair land,\nA journey of great joy and discovery lies ahead, so take heed.\n\nOn the morrow, thou shalt arrive in Tokyo, the city of gleaming towers,\nWhere ancient traditions and modern wonders intertwine like flowers in a bloom.\n\nVisit the Meiji Shrine, a sacred place where tranquility doth reign,\nAnd marvel at the torii gates, symbols of the divide between mundane and divine.\n\nWander through the bustling streets of Shibuya, where the crossings of people ebb and flow,\nLike a river of humanity, find oneself lost in the crowd, yet somehow, still whole.\n\nIn Asakusa, seek out the Senso-ji, a temple of ancient beauty,\nIts grand lantern proclaiming welcomes to all who enter, regardless of station or wealth.\n\nTaste the delights of the Tsukiji Fish Market, where seafood is king,\nFresh from the sea, it arrives on thy plate, a symphony of flavors to sing.\n\nOn the fifth day, depart for Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples,\nWhere the geishas still walk the streets, and the cherry blossoms dance in the wind.\n\nVisit the Kinkaku-ji, a temple of gold, a sight to behold,\nIts reflection on the pond, a vision of heaven on earth, a story to be told.\n\nStroll through the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, where the tall bamboo stalks sway,\nA forest of green, a whispering wind, a moment of peace in a busy day.\n\nOn the eighth day, journey to Hiroshima, the city of resilience,\nWhere the memories of the past still linger, yet the spirit of hope prevails.\n\nPay respects to the victims of the atomic bombing, at the Peace Memorial Park,\nA solemn reminder of the cost of war, a beacon of light in the darkness.\n\nLastly, on the ninth day, return to Tokyo, with memories to last a lifetime,\nA journey in Japan, in the land of the rising sun, a tale to be told, again and again.\n\nFare thee well, traveler, and may your journey be filled with joy, discovery and wonder.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.308956116437912}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.03075963631272316}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.2652597427368164}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -5.006777428206988e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.030119363218545914}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00028689560713246465}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.02283725142478943}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.00114994659088552}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "depart", "logprob": -3.3471367359161377}, {"token": "for", "logprob": -0.19334430992603302}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.5404632687568665}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.23252636194229126}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "fair", "logprob": -0.009439597837626934}, {"token": "land", "logprob": -0.7849941253662109}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.1656678467988968}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.00016032364510465413}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.1035923883318901}, {"token": "journey", "logprob": -0.08632864058017731}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -0.24500463902950287}, {"token": "great", "logprob": -0.1054457426071167}, {"token": "joy", "logprob": -0.04837699979543686}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -0.0013552061282098293}, {"token": "discovery", "logprob": -0.1758909821510315}, {"token": "lies", "logprob": -0.483274906873703}, {"token": "ahead", "logprob": -3.099436753473128e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.023963576182723045}, {"token": "so", "logprob": -1.7054133415222168}, {"token": "take", "logprob": -0.6370993852615356}, {"token": "he", "logprob": -0.00012289722508285195}, {"token": "ed", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.11646779626607895}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.05687470734119415}, {"token": "On", "logprob": -0.03462550416588783}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.0042669209651649}, {"token": "mor", "logprob": -0.45104074478149414}, {"token": "row", "logp